:: Lucas Hang Out End Late High Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */
As you are walking, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> starts to tell you about a recent game coming out that he is dying to play. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Took me FOREVER to convince my mom to let me preorder it. It’s TECHNICALLY rated M, but I kind of fibbed and lied about what the M stands for, she’s not up to date on gamer lingo, so I’ll just have to make sure I only play it if she’s not home.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> pauses briefly, blushing, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Don’t tell her any of this, by the way! Like, I will get in SO much trouble and will never forgive you!”</span> You both share a laugh, until <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> suddenly realizes that the sun has begun to set and panics.<br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
        {
        Name: "Lucas",
        State: {
            Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
            Mouth: "Frown",
            Blush: 1,
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Ahhhh! Shoot! When did the sun go down?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> quickly begins to gather his things and frantically gets ready to leave. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Shoot, shoot, shoot! If I’m out past dark, mom’s going to beat my butt! Sorry, I’ve got to run!”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">He quickly begins to hurry away as you laugh.</span> <br>
<br>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "Say goodbye<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You call out a goodbye, waving and telling <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> you’ll see him later. The boy looks back with a smile and flushed cheeks. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Bye! Sorry! I’ll see you later!”</span> You watch as the panicked boy disappears into the distance. <span style="color:LightGreen">That boy is too funny sometimes.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Park]][[Continue|Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "Ask for a proper goodbye<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You clear your throat loudly, causing <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> to stop in his tracks. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“What? Did I forget something?”</span> He says, still jogging in place. You tell him he did, he forgot to give you, his friend, a proper goodbye. <span style="color:LightGreen">What would his mom think if she saw how he was acting? <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> sighs and rolls his eyes, walking up to you smirking.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Right, right. Sorry.”</span> He gives you a friendly hug and pat on the back. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Goodbye, my friend, I shall see you tomorrow. Happy?”</span> You both laugh and you nod, accepting his goodbye and allowing him to leave. He hurries off and disappears into the distance as you smirk and shake your head. <span style="color:LightGreen">That boy is too funny sometimes.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
